/E (Including breaks and the difficulties of navigating by myself without GPS during air raids, I was realistically looking at 11 to 12 hours. Even if I left at 9am, that might have me arriving in Kramatorsk after sunset. It's safer to drive on roads at risk of drone attacks during the day.)
